    "description": "This charming Single-Family HOUSE in the heart of the Mission checks every box. Located just steps from the vibrant shops, restaurants, and culture of 24th Street, this bright and airy residence offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Inside, you'll find a beautifully remodeled kitchen with sleek dark cabinetry, glass accents, and a stylish backsplash, opening to a sunlit living area perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The updated bathroom features clean lines, modern fixtures, and a glass-enclosed tub/shower combo. A dedicated office nook makes working from home a breeze.    Additional highlights include a laundry area, a massive garage with incredible storage or creative-use potential, and private parking.  With its smart layout, modern upgrades, and unbeatable location, this jewel box wins over any alternative."
